WEBVTT

1
00:00:45.416 --> 00:00:47.458
Lord Krishna has explained so far

2
00:00:47.458 --> 00:00:50.291
that He will give Arjuna that jñāna and vijñāna

3
00:00:50.291 --> 00:00:54.291
by which he can know Lord
 Krishna without any doubt,

4
00:00:54.291 --> 00:00:57.166
and along with this, Lord Krishna also said

5
00:00:57.166 --> 00:00:58.666
that among thousands and lakhs,

6
00:00:58.666 --> 00:01:03.583
only one can completely
 understand his true form.

7
00:01:03.583 --> 00:01:06.958
Now in the coming nine verses, meaning

8
00:01:06.958 --> 00:01:09.541
from the fourth verse to the twelfth verse,

9
00:01:09.541 --> 00:01:12.500
Lord Krishna will explain His nature

10
00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:13.583
and will tell

11
00:01:13.583 --> 00:01:16.875
how both material and spiritual powers

12
00:01:16.875 --> 00:01:19.541
are a part of Him.

13
00:01:19.541 --> 00:01:23.125
In the fourth and fifth verses explained here,

14
00:01:23.125 --> 00:01:25.083
Lord Krishna is explaining

15
00:01:25.083 --> 00:01:29.750
the material and spiritual power
 pervading this world.

16
00:01:34.583 --> 00:01:38.416
First: in the fourth verse of the seventh chapter,

17
00:01:38.416 --> 00:01:41.750
Lord Krishna describes those eight elements

18
00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:42.666
which are the foundation

19
00:01:42.666 --> 00:01:45.958
of this material world, and He also explains

20
00:01:45.958 --> 00:01:49.041
that all these material elements

21
00:01:49.041 --> 00:01:51.416
are definitely a part of the power

22
00:01:51.416 --> 00:01:53.416
arising from Him,

23
00:01:53.416 --> 00:01:58.166
but are completely different
 from his real existence.

24
00:01:58.166 --> 00:02:00.250
The eight elements described

25
00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:04.208
in this verse are: bhūmi, meaning

26
00:02:04.208 --> 00:02:07.958
earth, apaḥ, meaning water,

27
00:02:07.958 --> 00:02:10.583
agni, meaning fire,

28
00:02:10.583 --> 00:02:13.375
vāyu, which we all know,

29
00:02:13.375 --> 00:02:16.958
khaṁ, meaning space, manas,

30
00:02:16.958 --> 00:02:20.708
meaning mind, and buddhi and ahaṅkāra.

31
00:02:20.708 --> 00:02:22.250
These elements are

32
00:02:22.250 --> 00:02:24.291
the basic foundation of the
 entire creation of the world,

33
00:02:24.291 --> 00:02:26.875
but Krishna emphasizes this point

34
00:02:26.875 --> 00:02:28.125
that consciousness is not

35
00:02:28.125 --> 00:02:29.916
present in any of these.

36
00:02:29.916 --> 00:02:33.333
For this very reason, they've been called 'hollow.'

37
00:02:33.333 --> 00:02:35.083
Also, Krishna, by using the word

38
00:02:35.083 --> 00:02:36.875
'bhinnā,'

39
00:02:36.875 --> 00:02:38.833
it clarifies that these elements

40
00:02:38.833 --> 00:02:40.166
have arisen from Him,

41
00:02:40.166 --> 00:02:43.541
but their form is certainly not the direct
 form of Krishna's 

42
00:02:43.541 --> 00:02:46.750
supreme consciousness or supreme power.

43
00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:48.000
These elements are definitely

44
00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:49.583
parts of creation,

45
00:02:49.583 --> 00:02:52.708
but they are lifeless and unconscious.

46
00:02:52.708 --> 00:02:55.708
The first five lifeless elements – earth,

47
00:02:55.708 --> 00:02:59.291
water, fire, air, and space

48
00:02:59.291 --> 00:03:01.708
create the material world,

49
00:03:01.708 --> 00:03:03.083
and all five are connected

50
00:03:03.083 --> 00:03:04.666
to the senses, meaning seeing,

51
00:03:04.666 --> 00:03:07.375
hearing, touching, smell,

52
00:03:07.375 --> 00:03:09.416
and taste.

53
00:03:09.416 --> 00:03:13.041
On the other hand, mind, intellect, and ego

54
00:03:13.041 --> 00:03:15.000
are such subtle elements

55
00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:18.208
that control our thoughts, decisions,

56
00:03:18.208 --> 00:03:21.083
and self-contemplation.

57
00:03:21.083 --> 00:03:24.083
Lord Krishna clarifies in the fifth verse

58
00:03:24.083 --> 00:03:27.416
that beyond this hollow material energy,

59
00:03:27.416 --> 00:03:30.291
there's also a higher spiritual power,

60
00:03:30.291 --> 00:03:32.833
and that is the jīvātmā,

61
00:03:32.833 --> 00:03:34.500
which is conscious.

62
00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:37.125
All bodies are made of lifeless material elements,

63
00:03:37.125 --> 00:03:39.875
but it's this consciousness

64
00:03:39.875 --> 00:03:42.833
that makes them living from lifeless.

65
00:03:42.833 --> 00:03:44.958
And because of living souls,

66
00:03:44.958 --> 00:03:46.791
this world is organized.

67
00:03:46.791 --> 00:03:49.583
But this matter must be understood well –

68
00:03:49.583 --> 00:03:51.333
the world being organized because of jīvātmās

69
00:03:51.333 --> 00:03:55.750
doesn't mean that we beings

70
00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:57.875
are running this world.

71
00:03:57.875 --> 00:04:02.958
Rather, its meaning is this –
 because of our presence,

72
00:04:02.958 --> 00:04:05.666
for us, this world has been created,

73
00:04:05.666 --> 00:04:08.541
and its arrangement has been made.

74
00:04:08.541 --> 00:04:12.291
Understand this with the
 example of Kumbh Mela...

75
00:04:12.291 --> 00:04:14.291
When the Kumbh fair takes place,

76
00:04:14.291 --> 00:04:16.625
then temporarily, an entire area

77
00:04:16.625 --> 00:04:19.291
becomes like a city.

78
00:04:19.291 --> 00:04:23.333
This city is built for pilgrims.

79
00:04:23.333 --> 00:04:25.750
But those pilgrims

80
00:04:25.750 --> 00:04:27.291
neither create this city,

81
00:04:27.291 --> 00:04:29.666
nor run it smoothly.

82
00:04:29.666 --> 00:04:31.958
It's been created only for their journey

83
00:04:31.958 --> 00:04:33.666
by someone else.

84
00:04:33.666 --> 00:04:35.750
Those pilgrims are definitely

85
00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:37.250
the reason for this city,

86
00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:40.291
but not its creators.

87
00:04:40.291 --> 00:04:41.916
Similarly, this world

88
00:04:41.916 --> 00:04:46.916
is such a city that has been
 created because of us, for us.

89
00:04:46.916 --> 00:04:49.166
In this verse, Lord Krishna explains

90
00:04:49.166 --> 00:04:52.166
that the spiritual power, which has been called

91
00:04:52.166 --> 00:04:53.333
'parā prakṛti,'

92
00:04:53.333 --> 00:04:56.333
is what enlivens the material elements.

93
00:04:56.333 --> 00:04:58.250
Without this consciousness power,

94
00:04:58.250 --> 00:05:01.916
material elements would
 remain lifeless and inactive.

95
00:05:01.916 --> 00:05:04.041
This verse inspires us

96
00:05:04.041 --> 00:05:07.166
to try to understand the
 spiritual purpose of our life,

97
00:05:07.166 --> 00:05:11.375
going beyond material elements and pleasures,

98
00:05:11.375 --> 00:05:13.208
because that is the real knowledge,

99
00:05:13.208 --> 00:05:15.750
and that alone gives meaning

100
00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:18.041
to this materialism.

101
00:05:22.791 --> 00:05:27.708
Material elements are hollow, lifeless.

102
00:05:27.708 --> 00:05:31.041
What makes them living is

103
00:05:31.041 --> 00:05:33.333
the soul.

104
00:05:33.333 --> 00:05:36.875
When a person also attains death,

105
00:05:36.875 --> 00:05:41.000
then neither name will remain,
 nor wealth, nor position,

106
00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:45.083
only this lifeless body will remain,

107
00:05:45.083 --> 00:05:48.833
which this world will burn to ash

108
00:05:48.833 --> 00:05:52.250
in the fire of cremation in just a few moments.

109
00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:56.125
Then what is your real existence?

110
00:05:56.125 --> 00:05:58.666
This lifeless body,

111
00:05:58.666 --> 00:06:03.541
or that soul which gives it life?

112
00:06:03.541 --> 00:06:06.541
One who knows this truth

113
00:06:06.541 --> 00:06:11.541
will also recognize their spiritual power.

114
00:06:11.541 --> 00:06:13.958
All elements of this world –

115
00:06:13.958 --> 00:06:19.333
whether they're material, mental, or emotional –

116
00:06:19.333 --> 00:06:22.625
all are part of material power.

117
00:06:22.625 --> 00:06:27.958
But your true form is the soul,

118
00:06:27.958 --> 00:06:31.708
which is far beyond all these materialities,

119
00:06:31.708 --> 00:06:33.958
and far superior.

120
00:06:33.958 --> 00:06:38.000
So what will you want to nourish in your life –

121
00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:41.125
your higher spiritual form,

122
00:06:41.125 --> 00:06:44.125
or momentary materialism?

123
00:06:44.125 --> 00:06:47.458
And just as these elements are material,

124
00:06:47.458 --> 00:06:51.875
similarly our emotions, desires, and thoughts

125
00:06:51.875 --> 00:06:54.583
are also material tendencies.

126
00:06:54.583 --> 00:06:57.458
Neither are these material
 things your true existence,

127
00:06:57.458 --> 00:07:00.125
nor are these material tendencies.

128
00:07:00.125 --> 00:07:02.458
All these should be

129
00:07:02.458 --> 00:07:04.750
under your control,

130
00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:07.583
not you under their control.

131
00:07:07.583 --> 00:07:09.208
But 

132
00:07:09.208 --> 00:07:13.583
many times the opposite happens.

133
00:07:13.583 --> 00:07:15.000
However, when you understand

134
00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:19.791
and adopt your spiritual truth,

135
00:07:19.791 --> 00:07:23.833
then you'll also regain your mastery.

136
00:07:23.833 --> 00:07:25.916
Then you'll do all those things

137
00:07:25.916 --> 00:07:28.375
that nourish this soul,

138
00:07:28.375 --> 00:07:30.416
that make it joyful.

139
00:07:30.416 --> 00:07:36.541
Remember, you are far above
 this materialism, and far superior.

140
00:07:36.541 --> 00:07:39.291
Don't become its servant.

141
00:07:39.291 --> 00:07:41.875
Recognize your spiritual power

142
00:07:41.875 --> 00:07:45.500
and take life in the right direction.

143
00:07:50.125 --> 00:07:52.875
In family settings,

144
00:07:52.875 --> 00:07:55.166
what is more valuable?

145
00:07:55.166 --> 00:07:57.416
Mutual love and relationships

146
00:07:57.416 --> 00:08:01.708
or material things?

147
00:08:01.708 --> 00:08:03.583
You'll say that

148
00:08:03.583 --> 00:08:07.833
mutual love and relationships
 are more valuable.

149
00:08:07.833 --> 00:08:11.541
But this is the irony –

150
00:08:11.541 --> 00:08:15.000
that in the glitter of materialism,
 people, even knowing this truth,

151
00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:18.916
have started ignoring it.

152
00:08:18.916 --> 00:08:20.958
Think about yourself,

153
00:08:20.958 --> 00:08:23.416
or look around you.

154
00:08:23.416 --> 00:08:26.250
Many examples of this will be found.

155
00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:27.458
Like

156
00:08:27.458 --> 00:08:32.041
a family that at one time never eats together,

157
00:08:32.041 --> 00:08:32.875
because

158
00:08:32.875 --> 00:08:34.166
everyone is busy chasing

159
00:08:34.166 --> 00:08:36.500
some materialism or other.

160
00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:37.583
Or some

161
00:08:37.583 --> 00:08:41.625
family that does eat at the same time,

162
00:08:41.625 --> 00:08:42.958
but

163
00:08:42.958 --> 00:08:46.041
perhaps the parents are busy on their phones,

164
00:08:46.041 --> 00:08:49.791
the children are watching some program on TV.

165
00:08:49.791 --> 00:08:51.583
Everyone is together

166
00:08:51.583 --> 00:08:53.333
in the same room,

167
00:08:53.333 --> 00:08:57.458
but no one is talking to each other.

168
00:08:57.458 --> 00:09:01.083
Here the attraction of devices is so much

169
00:09:01.083 --> 00:09:04.250
that it's starting to dominate relationships.

170
00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:07.291
Remember, if some thing breaks,

171
00:09:07.291 --> 00:09:10.000
it can be replaced, but

172
00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:12.750
if a crack comes in relationships,

173
00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:17.666
then filling it takes a lot of time.

174
00:09:17.666 --> 00:09:20.583
Understand this difference,

175
00:09:20.583 --> 00:09:24.791
and give priority to family relationships,

176
00:09:24.791 --> 00:09:28.583
not to material things or devices.

177
00:09:33.291 --> 00:09:36.625
When we view a workplace

178
00:09:36.625 --> 00:09:39.750
only from the perspective of material goals

179
00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:44.291
or production of material things,

180
00:09:44.291 --> 00:09:51.041
then attention remains fixed
 only on deadlines and profit

181
00:09:51.041 --> 00:09:53.000
Many times in this race of materialism,

182
00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:56.083
living people also remain

183
00:09:56.083 --> 00:09:59.875
only a thing.

184
00:09:59.875 --> 00:10:03.500
Such a thing that is only used for goals

185
00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:08.833
and many times even exploited.

186
00:10:08.833 --> 00:10:10.416
In such an environment,

187
00:10:10.416 --> 00:10:12.125
there's no respect for people

188
00:10:12.125 --> 00:10:15.291
or respect for their feelings,

189
00:10:15.291 --> 00:10:20.208
only assessment of their productivity happens.

190
00:10:20.208 --> 00:10:22.333
Such an environment going forward

191
00:10:22.333 --> 00:10:29.041
will only give unrest to that
 organization's owners too,

192
00:10:29.041 --> 00:10:32.291
and this will also happen
 with those senior officers

193
00:10:32.291 --> 00:10:34.958
who exploit people

194
00:10:34.958 --> 00:10:37.250
to achieve their goals.

195
00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:41.375
Because achievements that are
 established only on materialism

196
00:10:41.375 --> 00:10:45.625
and neglect of people

197
00:10:45.625 --> 00:10:48.916
will never give satisfaction.

198
00:10:48.916 --> 00:10:51.625
Not only this, people also

199
00:10:51.625 --> 00:10:56.000
won't like working in such an environment.

200
00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:57.916
Remember,

201
00:10:57.916 --> 00:11:02.125
such an environment where people get respect

202
00:11:02.125 --> 00:11:06.500
and encouragement becomes
 the foundation of lasting success

203
00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:10.708
and satisfaction.

204
00:11:10.708 --> 00:11:14.333
Take care of the people working with you,

205
00:11:14.333 --> 00:11:18.041
the organization will succeed on its own.
